--- log
setupterm nosuchterminal ERR errret 0
setupterm $TERM OK errret 1
tigetnum cols 20 lines 8
tigetnum of a string -2, of nothing -2
tigetflag am 0 bw 0, of a number -1
tigetstr cup \E[%i%p1%d;%p2%dH
tigetstr of a number (-1), of nothing (-1)
tparm cup 2 3 \E[3;4H
tparm setaf 4 \E[34m
tputs clear OK \E[H\E[J
vidputs bold underline OK \E[m\E[4m\E[1m
vid_puts reverse OK \E[m\E[7m
vid_puts with opts ERR
tgetent 1
tgetnum co 20 li 8
tgetflag am 0
tgetstr cm \E[%i%p1%d;%p2%dH, in the area 1
tgoto col 3 line 2 \E[3;4H
restartterm OK errret 1 cols 20
putp OK
del_curterm OK
--- [exit 0]
